      <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <airSeal>The air leakage was very high in this home. Air sealing beyond the % mentioned above will result in more significant savings. This could be difficult to achieve unless performed during other renovation upgrades (walls, ceiling).</airSeal>
                <mainWalls>By upgrading your wall insulation you could be eligible for up to $12,000 from the Yukon Good Energy Rebates
</mainWalls>
                <ceilings>By increasing your attic insulation to R-60 or more you could be eligible for a $2500 Yukon Good Energy Rebate. </ceilings>
                <windows>You are eligible for an additional $125 per window through the Good Energy
window rebate.
</windows>
                <HeatingSystem>There are currenly no Yukon Governemt rebates for upgrading to a condensing furnace but the energy savings would be significant. </HeatingSystem>
                <AdditionalComments />
            </RURComments>
